# What is NOT sent to shinyapps.io. The app reads R/, guide/, data/, www/, NEWS.md,
# global.R, ui.R and server.R, and the packages are restored from renv.lock (and
# BUILD_INFO, when the deployment writes it). Everything else stays out.

# renv: the packages come from renv.lock, and .Rprofile would source renv/activate.R,
# which is not sent
.Rprofile

# development: the CI, the editor, the tests and the documentation for contributors
.github
.vscode
.gitattributes
tests
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# local files that can hold something private (R saves the session, .Renviron holds
# secrets); rsconnect already leaves out .Rhistory
.RData
.Renviron
.Rhistory
